Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.51,0:00:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At night, a sound leaves\Nme unable to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.39,0:00:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There seems to be more\Nstray cats and dogs now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.19,0:00:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandfather went for a\Nwalk and has yet to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.61,0:00:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The nearby forest suddenly fell silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a few days now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.03,0:00:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the livestock have been afraid of\Nsomething and it's affecting their health.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.41,0:00:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems to be happening\Nall over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.17,0:00:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's similar to what happened\Nin the Forest of the Beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.41,0:00:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the enemy has already encroached\Nthis deep into the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All who use Search and Uncover!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.25,0:00:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to form a network and\Ndispatch to these areas now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.59,0:00:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, call on the Six Sovereigns!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.29,0:00:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is urgent!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.55,0:00:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of them? Really?\NYes! Hurry! Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.83,0:00:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did I not take notice of this earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.83,0:01:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this? Are those\Nbastards of the magical
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.15,0:01:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,empire really going\Nthis far what did we do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.35,0:01:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to provoke such actions\Ndo they really want
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.21,0:01:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into the dungeons so\Nbadly they resort to this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.23,0:01:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,countless lives will be\Ncaught in the light of fire
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's as if their only\Ndesire their only purpose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.35,0:01:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is coming into our\Nrealm just to destroy it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.45,0:01:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.23,0:03:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing we got a\Nlittle money in the end, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.11,0:03:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.81,0:03:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.97,0:03:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll do you a favor then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.01,0:03:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.05,0:03:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's in celebration of your first hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.61,0:03:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on now, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.07,0:03:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.31,0:03:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.17,0:03:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One goblin only gets you so much anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.43,0:03:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Food somehow tastes better\Nafter taking on a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.27,0:03:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure does.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so how long is this girl\Ngoing to be sticking around?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.03,0:03:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her folks must be worried sick about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.09,0:03:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.63,0:03:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, I think I'll head back to my\Nhome for the day and check on a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.49,0:03:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.13,0:03:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.04,0:03:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.49,0:03:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.59,0:03:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were a really big help today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please I absolutely look forward to assisting\Nyou again as long as you'll have me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.27,0:03:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been looking everywhere for you Lynn
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.69,0:03:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rain
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.21,0:04:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, nor
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.75,0:04:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the sudden request,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.49,0:04:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but would you do me the\Nservice of taking my
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.81,0:04:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sister to the Mountain\NDistrict tomorrow morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.09,0:04:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me I can give you a\Ncarriage and an escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm not able to give\Nyou any more details right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it would be of great help to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.41,0:04:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like I'll need to\Npack up for this journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.01,0:04:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will pay you well\Nand cover your expenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.91,0:04:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please sir, you are the only\Nperson I can trust with this task.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.29,0:04:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here we are, taking on\Na quest through the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.59,0:04:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master said to kick back and relax\Nwhile on the way there, and well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.13,0:04:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that sounds like a\Npretty sweet deal to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.55,0:04:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But to be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.87,0:04:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the real reason I accepted the task is\Nbecause I've never been on a carriage before,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.39,0:04:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I wanted to see what it's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.17,0:05:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For somebody like me, who's\Nnever really left the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.49,0:05:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is all the payment I could ever need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.13,0:05:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I'm lucky, I'll be able to go\Nto a bunch of other countries too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.79,0:05:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Lin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.79,0:05:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to see the scenery?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.11,0:05:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's just about\Ntime for the wheat harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.49,0:05:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We sure do live in a\Nland of plenty, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.49,0:05:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.83,0:05:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day, I want to become a normal\Nadventurer and do these journeys on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.49,0:05:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry my brother dropped this\Nrequest on you all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.09,0:05:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.39,0:05:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am getting paid for coming along,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.43,0:05:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I owe you for the goblin\Nhunt we just did anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.43,0:05:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First things first,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.87,0:05:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will travel northwest\Nof the capital via
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.29,0:05:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,carriage towards the\Nmountain district of Tauros.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.85,0:05:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, I need you to just\Nsit tight for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.11,0:06:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, but only if\Neverything seems to be copacetic,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.05,0:06:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll cross the mountain to\Nthe holy theocracy of Mithra.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.61,0:06:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really okay with me just\Nsort of coming along for the ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.21,0:06:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of it as like a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is, if nothing happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that everyone back home is\Ngoing to be okay while we're away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.67,0:06:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.35,0:06:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all just part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.47,0:06:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.61,0:06:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince himself told me to\Nkeep my orders a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.17,0:06:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the near future, the capital\Nwill fall into unprecedented crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should you receive report of\Nits destruction, at that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.69,0:06:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take Lin and together with Ser Noir\Nflee to Mithra as quietly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.43,0:06:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does Lady Lindbergh know of this, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.11,0:06:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She does not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.65,0:07:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were to tell her, she would\Nsurely refuse and stay behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if there's an emergency, I\Nwill be nowhere near the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.71,0:07:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is of utmost importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.19,0:07:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the only one I\Ncan trust with this task.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.17,0:07:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ines, it is your duty to\Nget her somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.53,0:07:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.29,0:07:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.59,0:07:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.15,0:07:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.57,0:07:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must apologize that you've\Nbecome caught up in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.67,0:07:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You make a simple trip sound so serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.69,0:07:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I gotta say, you haven't\Nbeen looking too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.37,0:07:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.39,0:07:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just a little troubled by something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.83,0:07:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But keeping you safe is another\None of my responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.43,0:07:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.25,0:07:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but I'm not really\Nworried about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.45,0:07:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I can protect\Nmyself if something comes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.35,0:08:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And can always run away if I need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.69,0:08:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't need to do that. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.63,0:08:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.07,0:08:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.73,0:08:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a shield?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.83,0:08:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.11,0:08:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you carrying anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.53,0:08:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my case, I don't\Nneed something to carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.07,0:08:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's better in many\Nways if I have nothing. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.27,0:08:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will be easier if I just show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Divine Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.51,0:08:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.42,0:08:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.71,0:08:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, if anything happens to us, hide\Nyourself behind this barricade of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.73,0:08:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither weapons nor magic can get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.91,0:08:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.82,0:08:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't have to tell me twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.13,0:08:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the guy with the spear who let me\Ntrain with him at the practice grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.15,0:08:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it was Gil? Phil?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.31,0:08:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Armadil?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, he's so great, he was able to\Nbring down a dragon all on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And she is no less powerful than he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're on a whole\Ndifferent level than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.67,0:09:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get into trouble with\Njust a single goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.77,0:09:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is a remarkable talent. Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.23,0:09:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talent, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.51,0:09:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shortly after being\Ntaken into an orphanage,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.35,0:09:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I noticed there was a mysterious\Npower growing within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.15,0:09:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inus, what's that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.65,0:09:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure is pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.21,0:09:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.12,0:09:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He caught me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.27,0:09:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone, call Director Save!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.95,0:09:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I healed her, so you need\Nnot worry anymore, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.31,0:09:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, show me the power\Nyou were using earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.73,0:10:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a gift that has been\Ngiven to you from the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.95,0:10:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a historically rare one at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.99,0:10:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could become a sharpened\Nblade able to cut anyone down,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.53,0:10:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or even a shield to protect\Nagainst adversaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.05,0:10:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Depending on how you use it, it could\Neven annihilate an entire country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.23,0:10:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ines, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.51,0:10:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.09,0:10:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can start learning\Nto use it beginning now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.21,0:10:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm ready now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.37,0:10:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, I was taken in by\Nthe Sovereign Shield Dandog.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.01,0:10:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I learned from the Six\NSovereigns how to use my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.27,0:10:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, I could not quell the fear\Nthat I would hurt someone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.63,0:10:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naturally, I started to put\Ndistance between myself and others,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.25,0:10:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I became detached.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.51,0:10:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I drifted away from everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.47,0:10:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least, I thought I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.65,0:11:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to have your\Nname, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.73,0:11:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.89,0:11:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.71,0:11:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that name very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.93,0:11:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never get distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.99,0:11:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dandalg was my foster father, and the\Ninstructor I held in the highest regard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.33,0:11:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was always teaching me, and\NI heard that name from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.67,0:11:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It never seems to end, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.33,0:11:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The onslaught shows no sign of relenting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.65,0:11:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I fear the soldiers\Nare beginning to fatigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.61,0:11:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's heavy times like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.67,0:11:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish that Noor were still around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.61,0:11:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That name again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, forget that. Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.41,0:11:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must be steadfast. Come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.27,0:11:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noor, someone worthy of\Nrespect by my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.65,0:12:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I have been right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.15,0:12:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My yearning for his\Nacknowledgement grew inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.09,0:12:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am somehow still envious\Nof a man I have never met.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.71,0:12:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now it's gotten worse, ever\Nsince he appeared before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.03,0:12:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.57,0:12:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I cannot allow my\Nfeelings to cloud my judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.15,0:12:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the shield of Clay's kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.37,0:12:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I protect Lady Lindbergh\Nwith my very life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.63,0:12:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.77,0:12:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.97,0:12:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a path in the wheat fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.79,0:12:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't really look right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.63,0:12:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Noor, something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.65,0:12:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.17,0:13:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I saw something strange\Nover there cutting through the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.07,0:13:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop, Inez!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.89,0:13:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.31,0:13:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.53,0:13:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reporting in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.35,0:13:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Several beasts have\Nappeared around the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.75,0:13:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Warrior Corps are handling it, but we\Ndon't have enough soldiers for them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.75,0:13:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have the Swordsman Company block the\Nroads immediately to fend them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.65,0:13:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instruct that all citizens\Nbe evacuated. Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tell the Secret Corps and the\NHunter Corps to send as many as
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.41,0:13:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,possible to fight the Monster Horde\Nand help stave off casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.41,0:13:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not allow a single\Ncitizen to fall. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.71,0:14:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That damned Eridus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.19,0:14:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There will come a day in your future\Nwhen you shall regret those words.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has finally come to make good on\Nhis threats he boasted about, has he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.39,0:14:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this is just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.57,0:14:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not believe it will end with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.09,0:14:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suppose not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.87,0:14:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Sovereigns?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.25,0:14:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have dispatched them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monsters have been seen\Nin various locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.45,0:14:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And at each one, we had\Nno choice but to engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.35,0:14:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defend this place at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.51,0:14:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave a single one alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.83,0:15:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our forces have been spread thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.37,0:15:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.45,0:15:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Lin is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.73,0:15:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She should be deep within\Nthe mountains by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.67,0:15:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.57,0:15:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.25,0:15:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.05,0:15:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A black death dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is such a vicious\Ncreature in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.35,0:15:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.29,0:15:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.17,0:16:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fairy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.07,0:16:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you not notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.25,0:16:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did not see that boy\Nin the field before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.23,0:16:28.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was only when you used your\NUncover skill that he appeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.25,0:16:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,along with the Black Death Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.55,0:16:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean that kid is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.23,0:16:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demon folk?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.66,0:16:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've heard of them, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.87,0:16:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.75,0:16:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They appear to be the same as humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.11,0:16:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they are demi-humans\Nwho have the special
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.61,0:16:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ability of establishing a\Nmental bond with monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.79,0:16:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.83,0:16:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they are closer to beasts\Nthan they are with humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.19,0:16:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they are considered\Naberrations and dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.95,0:17:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are records from 200 years ago\Nwhen the holy theocracy of Mithra
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.09,0:17:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was almost wiped out by demihumans who\Nwere manipulating powerful monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.61,0:17:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of that, the demon folk have\Nbeen continuously hunted by humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were thought to be extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.17,0:17:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now it would appear some of\Ntheir descendants are still around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.97,0:17:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.49,0:17:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then of course they must hold some intense
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.89,0:17:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hatred towards humans\Nfor their eradication.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.09,0:17:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the boy must have manipulated\Nthe dragon to follow him here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.69,0:17:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is a species which\Ndwells in the marshlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not known to go where humans live.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.83,0:17:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is unheard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.13,0:17:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meaning clearly that boy\Nintends to lead that monster to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.75,0:17:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the royal capital and do harm\Nto the citizens of our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.31,0:17:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have been the shock\Nof being exposed by Uncover
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.31,0:17:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that caused the boy to lose\Nhis mental hold on the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.89,0:17:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would Nord do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.85,0:17:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why protect someone like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.89,0:18:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.99,0:18:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.97,0:18:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What on earth is that man doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.55,0:18:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he even thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.89,0:18:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, let's help him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.09,0:18:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.15,0:18:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cannot help. Nor right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.79,0:18:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's on his own with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.23,0:18:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This frog it's not so powerful\Nand moves kind of slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.53,0:18:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That goblin was way tougher than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.99,0:18:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can just hold on until Lynn and\NInes get here, we can take it out. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.75,0:18:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I jump out of the way,\Nthe kid will get hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.37,0:18:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.45,0:18:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That liquid right there is\Nthe true horror of the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A deadly one at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.59,0:19:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My head is spinning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.45,0:19:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm losing control of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.57,0:19:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inez was trying to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.89,0:19:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She must have been trying to tell\Nme that this is no ordinary frog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.59,0:19:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It brings nothing but\Nruin to all in its path.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.99,0:19:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A special kind of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.89,0:19:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor Narl!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.47,0:19:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mustn't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.21,0:19:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A poisonous mist will come next.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.63,0:19:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let me go to him! I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.85,0:19:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My duty is to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.71,0:19:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.73,0:19:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can hold back its attacks from here\Nsomehow, at least the princess can escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kingdom needs her to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.15,0:19:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please understand, the very existence of\Nthe kingdom is at stake here. What in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.41,0:20:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess, you need to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.65,0:20:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One breath of that noxious\Ngas would be fatal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.45,0:20:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if Sovereign Healers saying we're\Nhere, you might not recover. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.23,0:20:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.41,0:20:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, get behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.41,0:20:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So for now, you just need\Nto make sure you survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.99,0:20:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Purify!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.63,0:20:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The purification won't make it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.83,0:20:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.77,0:20:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Noor, I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.31,0:20:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am but a mere soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.35,0:20:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I chose this path because of my\Nadmiration for Shield Sovereign Dandal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.75,0:20:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I see someone in the teeth of\Ndanger, I want to protect them, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.67,0:20:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.55,0:21:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.57,0:21:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.49,0:21:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's heavy times like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.21,0:21:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish that Noor were still around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.21,0:21:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this man anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.23,0:21:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He isn't being foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's exactly the type of person I've\Nalways looked up to and sought out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.75,0:21:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doing whatever you can to protect someone,\Neven if you must sacrifice yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.19,0:21:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A true shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.63,0:21:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.99,0:21:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard he was...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.83,0:22:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay then, I think I can\Nmake this work out after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.05,0:22:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.61,0:22:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master's. You can't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.95,0:22:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.41,0:22:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you. I can't see\Nanything. I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.31,0:22:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you what you're trying to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.87,0:22:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you what you're trying to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.31,0:22:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.97,0:23:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.25,0:23:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.89,0:23:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right back.

